{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00968","headline":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳 · 卢照邻","name":"横吹曲辞 折杨柳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倡楼啓曙扉，园柳正依依。\n鸟鸣知岁隔，条变识春归。\n露叶疑啼脸，风花乱舞衣。\n攀折聊将寄，军中书信稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}